---
import Label from "./Label.astro";
---

<section class="border-b border-neutral-950 py-20 sm:py-28">
	<Label>06 / Fast &amp; free</Label>
	<h2
		class="mt-6 max-w-3xl text-4xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight sm:text-5xl"
	>
		Fast by architecture. Free under fair use.
	</h2>
	<div class="mt-8 grid gap-8 sm:grid-cols-2">
		<p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-neutral-700">
			uppy runs on Cloudflare Workers and Workflows, at the edge. Update checks
			fan out their Datasource lookups in parallel, and every safe upgrade runs
			the full
			<span class="font-mono text-neutral-950"
				>clone → update → commit → push → PR</span
			>
			cycle inside its own isolated e2b sandbox.
		</p>
		<p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-neutral-700">
			No heavyweight runner to babysit, no queue to wait behind. When uppy
			launches it will be
			<span class="font-medium text-amber-600"
				>free under a fair-use policy</span
			>
			— normal, personal, and open-source use at no cost.
		</p>
	</div>
</section>
